rank-one pairing T(u) = sum_k V u(k) S_k over 12 row ray classes mod 4; R = |T|^2 / random-model size (mean 1 if u is unrelated to S)
lambda = cross-scale estimate (pairs of Y in [2^16, 2^18], disjoint s) of |T(rho)|^2 / random size; need: R <~ R_CS = n_eff/C (Cauchy-Schwarz with W)

